  "title": "HB 2056 (2021-2022 biennium (2021 and 2022 Regular Sessions)): Senate Substitute for HB 2056 by Committee on Federal and State Affairs - Changing the time period when advance voting ballots can be returned and regulating the use of remote ballot boxes (caption truncated on the page; see history_url)",
